WEBVTT

00:08:59.509 --> 00:09:01.033
to steal their bodies,

00:09:01.057 --> 00:09:02.676
their spirit

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.032
and their story.

00:09:05.954 --> 00:09:09.536
So as a child, I learned
to imagine an invisible finger

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.956
taking me from word to word,

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.356
from sentence to sentence,

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.908
from ignorance to understanding.

00:09:18.742 --> 00:09:22.322
So as technology continues to speed ahead,

00:09:22.346 --> 00:09:24.268
I continue to read slowly,

00:09:26.054 --> 00:09:29.809
knowing that I am respecting
the author's work

00:09:29.833 --> 00:09:32.422
and the story's lasting power.